    "EventReport": [
      {
        "uuid": "95006cda-7921-55fb-8ae2-7b98085bf73e",
        "name": "CLD-042 | Azure role assignment on ledgerarchive",
        "content": "For the cloud incident lead · 20 November 2026 · Exercise, internal distribution · Assessment at 10:00 UTC.\n\nFinding. @[object](031639b1-f1c9-5ffa-96d0-07c2391bf632) Whether the grant was approved and whether anyone read blobs remain open.\n\nScope. The case covers selected Azure Portal sign-in and Resource Manager records from 09:00 to 09:30 UTC in tenant d78a81b2-00b7-4e59-8e68-178c4a9c3410 and subscription 74097513-65cf-4ee6-84cb-7d485f31e831. All times below are UTC.\n\n09:14:11. Entra recorded a successful interactive sign-in by alex@tenant.example from 192.0.2.41. Entra record 1 @[object](400b45f4-1f64-5ecf-9d38-d6923abd0fff).\n\n09:16:03. Azure recorded the start of a role assignment write. The caller object ID matches the Entra user ID. The request names a different principal as recipient. Activity record 1 @[object](b5012152-c35b-5e91-b2e9-75b2a1526e0d).\n\n09:16:05. Azure recorded Succeeded / Created for the same operation. The response names service principal 6ab25386-9a59-465d-998f-9db68ef01272, the Storage Blob Data Reader role and the ledgerarchive account in rg-ledger. Activity record 2 @[object](e143c2a7-89a2-5630-9061-f6b49adde6ad).\n\nAttribution. The records identify a directory account. The evidence cannot identify the person controlling the session or prove that this particular sign-in supplied the token for the write.\n\nDisposition. The cloud IAM team should verify the assignment and approval with the resource owner. The storage team should preserve and examine blob read logs from the grant onward and record coverage. Containment and data impact are pending.\n\nEvidence E1. entra-signins.json, Graph value[0], SHA-256 7a1908b3bf28713d753b684e88151ce770a51f31c21df408fcbf63151e4d7208. @[object](68852750-858f-54f2-bf75-0e82410855bd)\n\nEvidence E2. azure-activity.json, Resource Manager value[0] and value[1], SHA-256 d6ab8e23d24d7dc8c9ec8a3df9b2c2aaaada55d3cad590503ed9cea843c90fd7. @[object](825f048f-e249-52ac-89b5-95de3dac9e1c)",
        "distribution": "5",
        "timestamp": "1795168800"
      }
    ]
